    <h1>Embedding Guru Vani Radio</h1>
    <p class="dev-lead">
      The stream is a plain, public MP3 feed over HTTPS. There is no API key, no
      account and no geoblocking, so a website, a native app or an Alexa skill
      can play it directly. These notes collect the endpoints, the format and
      the platform rules in one place.
    </p>
